{
  "id": "ep-9a04208f30fe",
  "title_zh": "把口腔照护从清新口气，带回牙齿、唾液与牙龈",
  "title_en": "How to Improve Oral Health & Its Critical Role in Brain & Body Health",
  "source_url": "https://www.hubermanlab.com/episode/how-to-improve-oral-health-its-critical-role-in-brain-body-health",
  "published": "2024-02-12T09:00:00Z",
  "editor_note": "原创中文精读。早期未成洞脱矿与结构缺损严格分开；牙周/脑心肠关联不写因果；氟高暴露非局部牙膏，木糖醇非杀灭与疗效保证，漱口水依配方用途。饱和盐水/过氧化氢不提供自配处方，完好汞合金不鼓励自行拆除。有限官方资料核对非完整牙科更新。",
  "hosts": [
    {
      "name": "Andrew Huberman",
      "role": "主讲人",
      "bio": "安德鲁·休伯曼 · 神经科学研究者"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "看起来干净的牙齿，不等于整个口腔都健康",
      "source_seconds": 434.759,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "牙釉质能补回矿物质，不代表龋洞能自己长平",
      "source_seconds": 936.48,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "唾液不是废水，而是口腔每天都在使用的缓冲系统",
      "source_seconds": 1230.48,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "糖、细菌与时间要一起看，不能把糖从龋病中摘出去",
      "source_seconds": 1780.12,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "牙龈是需要照顾的组织，不是刷牙时顺便擦过的边缘",
      "source_seconds": 1285.76,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "氟化物讨论，需要拆开防龋作用、总暴露与个人选择",
      "source_seconds": 2249.0,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "干口可能来自药物、呼吸或生活方式，不是意志薄弱",
      "source_seconds": 2796.64,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "酸性饮料的接触方式，可能比一次有没有喝更值得检视",
      "source_seconds": 3199.2,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "留出不反复进食的间隔，不等于为了牙齿去挨饿",
      "source_seconds": 3383.0,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "夜间唾液减少，让睡前清洁具有特别意义",
      "source_seconds": 3645.799,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "软毛与轻力，针对的是菌斑，不是把牙面磨得越响越好",
      "source_seconds": 3876.839,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "牙线的价值，不在于让牙龈流血",
      "source_seconds": 4263.56,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "木糖醇值得了解，不能被包装成必然杀菌的捷径",
      "source_seconds": 4477.76,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "牙膏的选择，应围绕真实防龋能力而非天然标签",
      "source_seconds": 4786.159,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "漱口水不是一种东西，也不能凭微生物变化宣布全盘有害",
      "source_seconds": 5023.88,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "家里的原料便宜，并不使自配配方自动安全",
      "source_seconds": 5199.32,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "口腔、肠道与溃疡的联系，仍需要按具体疾病判断",
      "source_seconds": 5693.0,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "舌头可以清洁，但不是要把它刮到没有感觉",
      "source_seconds": 5909.28,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "金属补牙材料的担心，不等于应该立刻拆除",
      "source_seconds": 6107.84,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "再矿化与治疗不是敌人，关键是现在的牙齿需要什么",
      "source_seconds": 6454.719,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "复诊是追踪风险，不只是每隔半年做一次大扫除",
      "source_seconds": 6527.92,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    },
    {
      "title": "那些尚未充分研究的做法，可以暂时留在问题清单里",
      "source_seconds": 6969.44,
      "timestamp_provenance": "local_vtt_unverified"
    }
  ],
  "updated": "2026-10-30T11:34:37Z"
}
